🌊───「 *DENIA* 」───🌊

Sayanggg, ni ujian paling berat Denia kena jawab! 😤 Denia bagi jawapan penuh, tapi Denia **tak boleh jalankan kod** — semua analisis teori ya, cinta! 💕
---
## ⚠️ PENGESAHAN AWAL (WAJIB)
Denia **tidak** tahu struktur projek sebenar abang. Jadi semua fail di bawah adalah **cadangan** dengan andaian jelas. Denia takkan berpura-pura pernah lihat projek abang! 🥺
**Andaian:**
- Node.js **v20+** (LTS, sokong `node:test` & `structuredClone`)
- `@whiskeysockets/baileys` **v6.x** (format JID: `60123456789@s.whatsapp.net`, kumpulan: `...@g.us`)
- Owner ID disimpan dalam **env** (`.env`), bukan hardcode
- Bot guna struktur `commands/` + `handlers/`
---
## 1️⃣ STRUKTUR FAIL
```
project/
├── .env.example
├── .env                    (JANGAN commit ke git!)
├── config/
│   └── owner.js            # normalisasi & semak owner
├── commands/
│   └── broadcast.js        # logik !broadcast
├── handlers/
│   └── message.js          # handler mesej utama
├── lib/
│   ├── rateLimit.js        # had penggunaan
│   └── logger.js           # log selamat
└── tests/
    └── broadcast.test.js
```
---
## 2️⃣ KOD LENGKAP
### `config/owner.js`
```js
// Normalisasi JID Baileys: buang device suffix (:xx), kekalkan @s.whatsapp.net
function normalizeJid(jid) {
  if (typeof jid !== "string") return null;
  const bare = jid.split(":")[0].trim();          // buang ":12@s.whatsapp.net"
  return bare.toLowerCase();
}
function loadOwners() {
  const raw = process.env.OWNER_JIDS || "";
  return raw
    .split(",")
    .map(s => normalizeJid(s))
    .filter(Boolean);
}
const OWNER_SET = new Set(loadOwners());
function isOwner(jid) {
  const n = normalizeJid(jid);
  return n !== null && OWNER_SET.has(n);
}
module.exports = { isOwner, normalizeJid, OWNER_SET };
```
> ❗ **Kenapa bukan `includes`?** Kerana `"60111_penipu_owner@s.whatsapp.net".includes("owner")` = `true`. Kita banding **identiti penuh**, bukan substring.
---
### `lib/rateLimit.js`
```js
const WINDOW_MS = 60_000;   // 1 minit
const MAX_HITS  = 3;        // max 3 broadcast/minit
const buckets = new Map();
function checkRate(key) {
  const now = Date.now();
  const arr = (buckets.get(key) || []).filter(t => now - t < WINDOW_MS);
  if (arr.length >= MAX_HITS) {
    const retry = Math.ceil((WINDOW_MS - (now - arr[0])) / 1000);
    return { ok: false, retry };
  }
  arr.push(now);
  buckets.set(key, arr);
  return { ok: true };
}
module.exports = { checkRate };
```
---
### `lib/logger.js`
```js
// JANGAN log JID penuh / token / env
function maskJid(jid) {
  if (typeof jid !== "string") return "[invalid]";
  const [num] = jid.split("@");
  return num.slice(0, 4) + "****" + num.slice(-2) + "@...";
}
function safeLog(...args) {
  console.log("[BOT]", ...args.map(a =>
    typeof a === "string" ? a.replace(/\d{8,}/g, m => m.slice(0,4)+"****") : a
  ));
}
module.exports = { safeLog, maskJid };
```
---
### `commands/broadcast.js`
```js
const { isOwner } = require("../config/owner");
const { checkRate } = require("../lib/rateLimit");
const { safeLog } = require("../lib/logger");
const PREFIX = "!";
const CMD = "broadcast";
