## 1️⃣ Risiko `getSenderJid()` memaksa `@s.whatsapp.net`
**Kelemahan yang Denia jumpa dalam kod Ujian 9:**
```js
return jid.split(":")[0].split("@")[0] + "@s.whatsapp.net";
```
- ❌ Buang domain asal → **`@lid`, `@hosted`, `@hosted.lid` semua ditukar jadi `@s.whatsapp.net`**.
- ❌ Kalau `OWNER_JIDS` guna format `@lid`, semakan owner **selalu gagal**.
- ❌ `split(":")[0]` salah untuk JID yang sah tanpa device suffix.
**PEMBETULAN (CONTOH):**
```js
// lib/jid.js
const USER_DOMAINS = new Set(["s.whatsapp.net", "lid", "hosted", "hosted.lid"]);
function normalizeJid(jid) {
  if (typeof jid !== "string") return null;
  const [userPart, domain] = jid.split("@");
  if (!userPart || !domain) return null;
  const user = userPart.split(":")[0]; // buang device suffix
  if (!USER_DOMAINS.has(domain)) return null;
  return `${user}@${domain}`;
}
function getSenderJid(msg) {
  const key = msg?.key ?? {};
  const remote = key.remoteJid;
  if (typeof remote !== "string") return null;
  const isGroup = remote.endsWith("@g.us");
  const raw = isGroup ? key.participant : remote;
  return normalizeJid(raw);
}
```
**Nota:** perbandingan owner mesti guna **JID ternormal** yang sama format dengan `OWNER_JIDS`.
---
